# ==========================================
# Xcode & Swift Project Gitignore Template
# ==========================================

## Build generated files
build/
DerivedData/

## User settings (Forces Xcode to stop tracking personal window layouts)
xcuserdata/

## Architecture & Crash logs
*.framework
*.xctest
*.app
*.dSYM
*.dSYM.zip
*.crash
*.ips

## Xcode 8 and earlier compatibility 
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Swift Package Manager (SPM)
# It is generally recommended to keep Package.resolved tracked so your team 
# uses identical dependency versions. Uncomment the next line if you prefer otherwise.
#.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
#Package.resolved

## CocoaPods (Optional)
# Keeping the Pods directory tracked ensures a plug-and-play repo clone.
# Uncomment the line below if you prefer downloading them via 'pod install' every time.
# Pods/

## Carthage
Carthage/Build/

## macOS System Files
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
